  "mach:judgement": "Adopt",
  "mach:judgementReason": "The original and most comprehensive open-source implementation of the DICOM standard, maintained by OFFIS e.V. since the 1990s. BSD-3-Clause, 879 stars, actively maintained (v3.7.0, January 2026). Covers the full DICOM stack: encoding, networking, compression, structured reporting, and RT. Underpins many commercial PACS and imaging middleware systems. The reference toolkit for any team implementing DICOM at the protocol level.",
  "mach:editorialReviewedAt": "2026-05-22",
